{"event_type":"review","id":"21a4171d20638cd6e32d9cb985f8ce001d24bfe3eccc797d8bf3d40b02dfa701","occurred_at":"2026-11-15T08:53:50Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/082319c8d8b9a16cb3c3606309582ab2a277317c4ee91529ceec4edc45237d57","sha256":"082319c8d8b9a16cb3c3606309582ab2a277317c4ee91529ceec4edc45237d57"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/19527b675bbdb4775c88f8e94a93770db9a4858da1b304757ff940dc93149ac3","sha256":"19527b675bbdb4775c88f8e94a93770db9a4858da1b304757ff940dc93149ac3"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/3497f4aa3ee9bba76c61490cac5ee953aba3650a8d034b9beea7c6a4004caf05","sha256":"3497f4aa3ee9bba76c61490cac5ee953aba3650a8d034b9beea7c6a4004caf05"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/e59a8b58d1e66a8b2a208f16338493a6adf972baf7d840b60e09f7b21da5dc74","sha256":"e59a8b58d1e66a8b2a208f16338493a6adf972baf7d840b60e09f7b21da5dc74"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/3439c4a359e1c851bfab83d208c9d03c5ac7a40e26e107d05c0c9a02233c4de7","sha256":"3439c4a359e1c851bfab83d208c9d03c5ac7a40e26e107d05c0c9a02233c4de7"}],"attempt_id":"71c3d60a0b547b441d059d7b442f70d51d0faea325c53e066087d0c51078ab16:0:1","base":"6c68b19fdca38d386ac6612fff9fd4c55408954b","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"f601cc531cc7c0453049d39d4e49ae014c171192","body":"**Retry the completion checks when a contender briefly holds the completion lock.**\n\nThe `withLock` mutex is released before `publishCompletion` runs. If another run acquires the mutex before the `lstat` at `addressOwnership.ts:637-638`, the check throws. That run refuses, since it reads the ACTIVE guard. Completion then fails, but the store keeps an ACTIVE guard and an uncommitted `pending-*` staging link. Every later admission refuses with \"attended recovery required\", and no path recovers that state.\n\nThe lock artifact exists only while the mutex is held. The race therefore needs a second run to acquire the mutex between release and line 637. Retry the predecessor, staging, and lock-absence checks with a bounded wait before `link` at line 650. Fail if the lock is still held when the bound expires.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Suggested change</summary>\n\nProse only. The change is a bounded retry around the pre-link checks in `publishCompletion`. Re-run `identityAfter`, the staging comparison, and the `lstat` on `cq-review-address-ownership.lock` on each attempt. Call `link` only after the lock is absent.\n\n</details>","id":"1bd565d490911fc572748b1b863b97a506a3dbde34758f4696529f995cbe0aec","intervals":[[637,638]],"path":"src/ops/review/internal/addressOwnership.ts","severity":"major","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Retry the completion checks when a contender briefly holds the completion lock."}],"head":"0848d683912a70339ef8d6bd28572c79ce1b4920","head_tree":"26c3b0934808252bdcdb6b4602387f222cc522cf","input_scope":[{"blob":"f601cc531cc7c0453049d39d4e49ae014c171192","intervals":[[1,1175]],"path":"src/ops/review/internal/addressOwnership.ts"}],"job_id":"71c3d60a0b547b441d059d7b442f70d51d0faea325c53e066087d0c51078ab16:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"f601cc531cc7c0453049d39d4e49ae014c171192","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/ops/review/internal/addressOwnership.ts","reason":"bounded verified input"}],"policy_digest":"eacd1bcf42a0e72eca72fcf9c1e9c8f97e7c515cd67a8fa7965c966924647693","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","requested_scope":[{"blob":"f601cc531cc7c0453049d39d4e49ae014c171192","intervals":[[911,918],[920,921],[924,924],[928,937]],"path":"src/ops/review/internal/addressOwnership.ts"}],"reviewed_scope":[{"blob":"f601cc531cc7c0453049d39d4e49ae014c171192","intervals":[[911,918],[920,9